---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Website privacy"
  description="How the Stocker website handles library searches and calculator inputs, and where to find the app’s separate privacy policy."
  ><div class="container text-page">
    <h1>Website privacy</h1><div class="prose">
      <p>Last updated: November 8, 2026.</p><h2>Searches and calculations</h2><p
      >
        The website's library search and calculators run in your browser. The
        site does not send library search text or calculator inputs to Stocker
        or Google Analytics.
      </p><h2>Pages and hosting</h2><p>
        Loading a website necessarily sends a request to its host. Hosting and
        infrastructure providers may process technical connection information
        such as an IP address to serve and protect the site. Cloudflare Pages
        hosts this website and may process connection and security logs, plus
        cookieless performance and usage statistics.
      </p><h2>Optional analytics</h2><p>
        With your permission, Google Analytics measures page visits, general
        usage and App Store button clicks. It may use cookies and process
        technical information such as device and referral details. Advertising
        personalization and Google signals are disabled. Google Analytics does
        not load until you choose Allow analytics.
      </p><p>
        Your analytics choice is saved in this browser. Use Analytics
        preferences in the footer to change it. Declining prevents analytics
        loading on subsequent page views. Google describes its processing in <a
          href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">its privacy policy</a
        >.
      </p><h2>External links</h2><p>
        Links to the App Store, company filings and other websites take you to
        services with their own privacy practices. A download button does not
        create a Stocker account on this website.
      </p><h2>The Stocker app</h2><p>
        The app has its own data practices, which are described in the <a
          href={SITE.privacy}>Stocker app privacy policy</a
        > and <a href={SITE.appStore}>App Store privacy information</a>. This
        website notice does not replace those documents.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div></SiteLayout
>
